          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why there is no live preview provided?",
            "answer": "<p>We do NOT provide live previews of nameplates, as they can be misleading and are applicable to only a few products.</p><p>We have a specialized team dedicated to creating better designs based on your content. Most of our nameplates are cutout designs, where a single font may not look aesthetic.</p><p>Our designers evaluate the content, select fonts that complement the design, and create a layout accordingly. The final design is then sent to you for approval.</p><p>Feel free to place your order!</p>"
