        "pfaq_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can the products be customised if we provide design?",
            "answer": "<p>That depends on the design you are offering. Once we review it, our design or creative team will let you know if it is possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_Ff6TkK": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can we provide our own fonts?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, you can, but not all fonts available on the internet can be used. Some are intended only for printing purposes.</p><p>However, we can customize the fonts you provide. You can select fonts from websites like FontSpace, Google Fonts, or any other downloadable font website, and send us the font files at <a href=\"mailto:support@royalgifts.co.in\">support@royalgifts.co.in</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "pfaq_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Why are product prices high?",
            "answer": "<p>The primary reason for our pricing is the superior quality we provide. We use high-grade mild steel or stainless steel.</p><p>For mild steel, while other competitors use 2.5-3mm thickness, we provide 4.5mm thickness for enhanced durability. Additionally, the powder coating we use is 100% polyester, ensuring a premium finish.</p><p>We have our own manufacturing unit and are a GST-registered company.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_qjHaRn": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can the nameplates be customised in regional languages?",
            "answer": "<p>Indeed, all you need to do is provide the content in your regional language.</p><p>We already have fonts in Telugu, Tamil, Kannada, Marathi, and Hindi. If you require any other language, please provide the content in a PDF with your desired fonts, and we will take care of the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
